\begin{inshort}[Purpose of this report]
This report is prepared for Bojan Ničeno, developer of T-Flows and
supervisor of the master's work by Lobresco that led to the benchmark
paper~\cite{Lobresco2026}. It connects that shared starting point to the
OpenFOAM case ladder: Bojan's carrier and transport cases 001--011, then
Jan's wall-exchange and chemistry cases 012--024. The central questions
are which equations have changed, how conservation is enforced, and what
the comparisons actually establish. Case 022 checks reproduction of the
T-Flows temperature model; case 023 tests the extended physical model
against five experiments. These are different tests, not a ranking of CFD
codes. The reported onset RMS error is 18\,K versus about 35\,K for the
published models, conditional on the reconstructed experimental inputs.
\end{inshort}

