\textbf{024 --- the full Pb--Bi--I chemistry.} Liu et
al.~\cite{Liu2025} evaporated pure iodides and iodine-containing LBE into
helium in steel and silica columns. Case 024 runs their configurations with
the full chemistry of 021 on the realistic flows of 017, 60\,s each on a
